<title>AUSTRALIA: Cricket-West Indies beat Pakistan by six wickets.</title>
<headline>Cricket-West Indies beat Pakistan by six wickets.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies beat Pakistan by six wickets in their World Series limited overs match on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores - Pakistan 197 all out in 49.5 overs (Ijaz Ahmed 59). West Indies 198-4 48.1 overs (Carl Hooper 54 not out)</p>
